            <h2>How It All Started</h2>

            <p>
                In June 2025, what began as a messy afternoon experimenting with
                polymer clay at a kitchen table quickly blossomed into an obsession.
                The first few pieces were wobbly and imperfect, but they possessed
                a certain undeniable charm.
            </p>

            <p>
                Encouraged by friends, we took a leap of faith and set up a small
                folding table at our local weekend market. The response was
                unexpectedly heartwarming. Seeing people smile at these tiny
                creations sparked a realization: we weren't just making art;
                we were crafting little moments of joy.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="story-image-card">

