            <h2>Made with Care</h2>

            <p>
                Every single piece in our collection is 100% handmade and
                meticulously hand-painted. We don't use molds for our figures;
                each one is sculpted from scratch, ensuring that no two pieces
                are exactly alike. It's a slow process, but it's the only way
                to guarantee that unique, artisanal touch.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="value-card">

            <div class="value-icon">
                &#127800;
            </div>

            <h2>Why We Create</h2>

            <p>
                In a fast-paced digital world, we crave the tactile and the
                whimsical. We create to bring a smile to your face, to add a
                spot of color to a dull desk, or to offer a unique gift that
                feels deeply personal. Our ultimate goal is to spark joy
                through artful simplicity and cozy aesthetics.
            </p>

